  "notes": "FireBeetle-style ESP32-WROOM-32E board graphic (no product name printed). GPIO numbers are printed as bare 'Port PIN' numbers and used as labels; IDE names (D9, A4...) and other functions follow outward. Right pin 4 (GPIO4) is printed ADC1_CH0 and copied as printed. Colour legend omitted. Skipped USB-C, RST and 27 buttons, LEDs, battery JST (+/- only) and the FPC connector (no pin labels). NC appears only on the silkscreen."
